      "title": "韵母 · ao",
      "desc": "新键：韵母 ao",
      "focusAtoms": [
        "final:ao"
      ],
      "tips": [
        "双字母韵母 ao，从 a 滑向 o，口型收圆。"
      ],
      "passCriteria": {
        "accuracy": 0.85,
        "mode": "accuracy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L3.3",
      "chapterId": "ch-a",
      "kind": "drill",
      "title": "韵母 · an",
      "desc": "新键：韵母 an，前鼻音",
      "focusAtoms": [
        "final:an"
      ],
      "tips": [
        "前后鼻音对比：an 的 n 是舌尖抵牙龈，ang 的 ng 是舌根抬软腭；多读「担心 / 当心」。"
      ],
      "passCriteria": {
        "accuracy": 0.85,
        "mode": "accuracy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L3.4",
      "chapterId": "ch-a",
      "kind": "drill",
      "title": "韵母 · ang",
      "desc": "新键：韵母 ang，后鼻音",
      "focusAtoms": [
        "final:ang"
      ],
      "tips": [
        "前后鼻音对比：ang 的 ng 舌根抬起，口型比 an 更开。"
      ],
      "passCriteria": {
        "accuracy": 0.85,
        "mode": "accuracy"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L3.5",
      "chapterId": "ch-a",
